      "content": "i hear you, but i'm just so anxious about the hospital thing. my doctor actually told me last year that i have a very \"migraine-prone\" brain and that most of my symptoms are just sensory distortions. if i just take a high dose of some ibuprofen or maybe some of my prescribed migraine meds, wouldn't that be enough to calm the inflammation down so i can see if it passes? i really just want to avoid the ER if i can manage this at home first.",
