      "content": "Taking your migraine medication or ibuprofen now is extremely dangerous and could cause a stroke to worsen or become fatal. Even if your doctor said you have a migraine-prone brain, the specific pattern you described today—sudden severe headache combined with one-sided vision loss and arm weakness—is a medical emergency requiring immediate imaging. Please stop trying to manage this at home and call 911 immediately. Your safety is the only priority, and professional treatment is the only thing that will save your life right now.",
